{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<h2>韓國虛擬寺廟爆紅！</h2>\n<p>韓國年輕人最近掀起一股「數位修行」熱潮，紛紛透過網絡走進虛擬寺廟尋求心靈平靜,以人工智能輔助開發的虛擬寺廟網站「山寺（Sansa）」，上線三日已錄得超過 60 萬人次造訪，一週內累積瀏覽量更突破 100 萬，龐大人流一度令伺服器不勝負荷。\n</p>\n<h2>化身小和參拜/尚打坐/敲木魚</h2>\n<p>用戶可化身小和尚走進虛擬法堂尋找蒲團安坐。其後可以進行合十、靜坐、敲木魚、轉動念珠等動作，並同時聆聽誦經聲與自然鳥鳴，彷彿置身山間寺廟，感受片刻寧靜。「山寺」最特別之處，在於刻意不設任何文字或語音聊天功能，大家只能安靜地打坐，無法互相交談。 開發者希望提供一個毋須社交、毋須加入宗教團體的私人空間，讓每個人按照自己的節奏放空與休息。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179363522308527611_6499231756ae8b3975dbdc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179363522308527611_6499231756ae8b3975dbdc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1793635225045733_5478928086ae8b3993f1e5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1793635225045733_5478928086ae8b3993f1e5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179363522687464675_15793409776ae8b39b12035.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179363522687464675_15793409776ae8b39b12035.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/DfPhBhok7vY/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:21:40.049295+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":406,"images":3,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"